From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:58:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 216/342] meson_encoder: H.264 from the S905's encoder for the
 Media Kit

"H.264 (hardware)", short name "h264": B_RGB32 pictures straight into
meson_venc's input area (the hardware converts them), an IDR picture
every two seconds with the SPS and PPS in front, one QP a picture from
the quality (0.75, the default, is QP 26). The microcode comes from
meson_venc_firmware's data. meson_venc logs a command's interrupts only
when it fails.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
